<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-KIA MOTORS FIRST HALF LOSS DEEPENS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-KIA MOTORS FIRST HALF LOSS DEEPENS.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)	     (loss)  491 vs  (loss)  137</p>
<p>    Net		     (loss) 37.0 vs  (loss) 10.3</p>
<p>    Profit before tax    (loss) 37.0 vs (loss) 10.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,389.6 vs 3,029.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Kia Motors Corp, a unit of the Kia Group, said the rise in losses stemmed from slumping domestic sales and the debut of rival Daewoo Motor's new model cars.</p>
</text>
